5
00:00:15,610 --> 00:00:18,415
Lease Activated — First Month Prorated — The tenant record shows the reduced first charge at a glance.

6
00:00:18,483 --> 00:00:21,913
Statement Reflects the Proration — A daily rate for the days actually occupied — full rent from the second month on.

