9
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:33,984
New: Operational & Sundry Charges — One-off charges beyond rent — a call-out fee, common-area cleaning — billed straight to the lease.

10
00:00:34,148 --> 00:00:36,557
Charge Added — The balance updates immediately, and the tenant is emailed a notice.

11
00:00:36,557 --> 00:00:40,160
New: Electricity Metering — A configured rate per property, plus manual meter readings — consumption bills itself automatically.

12
00:00:40,319 --> 00:00:43,726
Reading Recorded — Consumption since the last reading, at the property's rate, becomes an ELECTRICITY charge automatically.

13
00:00:43,726 --> 00:00:47,130
New: Variable / Escalating Rent — A rent change mid-lease — an annual escalation — takes effect from a chosen date forward.

14
00:00:47,287 --> 00:00:50,895
Revision Scheduled — Every billing period now bills at the rate in effect on its own due date — past periods are untouched.

15
00:00:50,895 --> 00:00:55,099
New: Automated Recurring Billing — A daily scheduler job bills each elapsed period exactly once — this lease's full invoice history, generated hands-free.

16
00:00:56,145 --> 00:00:58,949
RentalPro — What's New: The Billing Engine — Signing in as Property Owner (owner@rentalpro.com)

17
